## 1. First access

Open the app's link (or the `index.html` file) in your browser. The first time, the screen appears empty, with a **"+ Create first class"** button.

> 💡 Want to install it as a real app (icon on your screen, works 100% offline)? See the separate installation guide, or look for the **"📲 Download app"** button, which appears on its own inside the tools panel when your browser allows installation.

